M140 S85 ; set bed temp
M190 S85 ; wait for bed temp
M109 S250 ; wait for extruder temp
G28 W ; home all without mesh bed level
G80 X97.6229 Y82.6229 W54.7542 H44.7542 ; mesh bed levelling

